From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tanjilbhuiyan <tanjilbhuiyan@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 03:34:46 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 18/35] arm64: dts: exynos9610: add the six pin controllers and
 their banks

Controllers and aliases follow the mainline driver order (ALIVE, CMGP,
DISPAUD, FSYS, TOP, SHUB); bank names from the driver data, wake-up SPIs
and controller interrupts from the stock Samsung DT. Layout as
exynos850-pinctrl.dtsi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I6a67bface4bd5d90123099a56db63dd0faefc813
---
 .../boot/dts/exynos/exynos9610-pinctrl.dtsi   | 481 ++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9610.dtsi    |  62 ++-
 2 files changed, 540 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9610-pinctrl.dtsi

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9610-pinctrl.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9610-pinctrl.dtsi
new file mode 100644
