+ * mainline driver data (drivers/pinctrl/samsung/pinctrl-exynos-arm64.c, commit 8c483209a6fc).
+ * Wake-up interrupt SPIs per bank from the stock Samsung DT of the Galaxy A50 (A505FDDS9CWA2,
+ * reference/stock-dt in the a50-kernel-6.18 project); banks without an interrupt there have none here.
+ * Layout follows exynos850-pinctrl.dtsi.
